{
    "title": "\u0634\u0647\u0631\u0628\u0627\u0646\u0648 - \u0628\u0627\u0632\u06cc \u0641\u06a9\u0631\u06cc \u0648 \u0645\u0639\u0645\u0627\u06cc\u06cc",
    "description": "Solve different addictive puzzles\r\nThe new challenge of solving word puzzles!\r\n\r\nOnce upon a time, a letter arrived in the hands of Shahr-Bano, which was written in a nice and beautiful handwriting. Your grandfather's legacy has reached you... but there was a condition that you must first discover the riddles that were left! Shahrabano, who loved adventure and excitement, enters the old mansion of her ancestors to discover the secrets of her grandfather's mysteries.\r\nTo help the lady of the city, solve fun and interesting riddles and puzzles and enjoy this stage game and game with friends.\r\n\r\nCharacteristics of Shahrabano\r\n+ Simple and attractive puzzles with addictive gameplay!\r\n+ More than 3000 levels and thousands of different puzzles!\r\n+ Discover the secrets of fascinating and different audio and video puzzles!\r\n+ Finding dozens of antiques from different periods of Iran's history\r\n+ Dozens of new questions and puzzles in the daily game\r\n+ Play with friends and challenge each other in the challenge game (popular Wordly games)\r\n+ Traditional and eye-catching graphics with attractive Iranian characters\r\n+ Beautiful and pleasant Iranian traditional music\r\n+ A relaxing game for all ages\r\n+ Strengthen memory and prevent Alzheimer's\r\n+ A different experience from table and word guessing games\r\n+ Ability to share and play with your friends\r\n\r\nIn the new game with friends section, you can create a new game for your friends and challenge each other and share your win statistics.\r\n\r\nShahrabano is waiting for you! If you are looking for a puzzle game for boys or girls, or if you want a cool new free game, and you have a lot of skill in intellectual games like Amirza and Quiz of King or our other games like Fandh, Samavar, and Kandune, and even if you love games like Golmarad or Are you a gardener or even Candy Crush, the game of Shahrabano is made just for you and wherever you are, whether you are in the subway or Snap and Tapsi, you can play the game and bag it. Start right now and get help from your friends on social networks such as WhatsApp, Telegram and Instagram\r\n\r\nIt doesn't matter if you like boys' games or new girls' games or even adult intellectual games because all family members can enjoy this Iranian game to the fullest and add to their general knowledge and challenge their minds.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solve different addictive puzzles<br>The new challenge of solving word puzzles!<br><br>Once upon a time, a letter arrived in the hands of Shahr-Bano, which was written in a nice and beautiful handwriting. Your grandfather&#39;s legacy has reached you... but there was a condition that you must first discover the riddles that were left! Shahrabano, who loved adventure and excitement, enters the old mansion of her ancestors to discover the secrets of her grandfather&#39;s mysteries.<br>To help the lady of the city, solve fun and interesting riddles and puzzles and enjoy this stage game and game with friends.<br><br>Characteristics of Shahrabano<br>+ Simple and attractive puzzles with addictive gameplay!<br>+ More than 3000 levels and thousands of different puzzles!<br>+ Discover the secrets of fascinating and different audio and video puzzles!<br>+ Finding dozens of antiques from different periods of Iran&#39;s history<br>+ Dozens of new questions and puzzles in the daily game<br>+ Play with friends and challenge each other in the challenge game (popular Wordly games)<br>+ Traditional and eye-catching graphics with attractive Iranian characters<br>+ Beautiful and pleasant Iranian traditional music<br>+ A relaxing game for all ages<br>+ Strengthen memory and prevent Alzheimer&#39;s<br>+ A different experience from table and word guessing games<br>+ Ability to share and play with your friends<br><br>In the new game with friends section, you can create a new game for your friends and challenge each other and share your win statistics.<br><br>Shahrabano is waiting for you! If you are looking for a puzzle game for boys or girls, or if you want a cool new free game, and you have a lot of skill in intellectual games like Amirza and Quiz of King or our other games like Fandh, Samavar, and Kandune, and even if you love games like Golmarad or Are you a gardener or even Candy Crush, the game of Shahrabano is made just for you and wherever you are, whether you are in the subway or Snap and Tapsi, you can play the game and bag it. Start right now and get help from your friends on social networks such as WhatsApp, Telegram and Instagram<br><br>It doesn&#39;t matter if you like boys&#39; games or new girls&#39; games or even adult intellectual games because all family members can enjoy this Iranian game to the fullest and add to their general knowledge and challenge their minds.",
